// ============================================================
// TREASURE BOX — per-level config (data-driven: { count, hitsRequired }
// per level, same pattern as chocolate/bombs/rainbow above). Cells
// themselves are never hard-coded by row/col — initializeTreasureCells()
// below places `count` treasure boxes on random eligible filled candy
// cells at level start (identical placement strategy to Locked/Frozen/
// Jelly/Bomb/Rainbow). A level with no entry here has no Treasure Box at
// all. Introduced gradually per spec: 181-184 (1 box), 185-188 (2),
// 189-192 (2-3), 193-196 (alongside Rainbow, already configured above for
// these same levels), 197-199 (alongside one existing obstacle — see
// CUSTOM_LEVEL_OBJECTIVES: 197 frozen, 198 locked, 199 jelly). Level 200
// gets one Treasure Box too, as part of its boss-finale "Phase 3" flavor
// — see CUSTOM_LEVEL_OBJECTIVES[200].
// ============================================================
const CUSTOM_LEVEL_TREASURE = {
